@flexiarg operator/mark-the-standing-of-the-claim
@title Mark The Standing Of The Claim
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-6li1fC turn-X0awal
@parent writing-coherence/hedged-lift
@context A retrospective is given from memory and a record exists.

! conclusion: Treat the account as a reading to check, go to the record, and report where it differs.

  + IF:
    The operator says it is how he sees it and the record might differ.

  + HOWEVER:
    The listener may take the account as settled.

  + THEN:
    Treat the account as a reading to check, go to the record, and report where it differs.

  + BECAUSE:
    The account's standing is stated, so it can be tested.
